-- A call script for examples/natkit.lang (S7 s4, Q-S7-16 (a)): the four USER
-- values of toNat. 0u and 18446744073709551615u (2^64 - 1) set n, and nOf
-- reads it. 18446744073709551616u (2^64) and the largest U256 revert, and n
-- keeps the value of row 3.
1 1u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb setN 0u
2 2u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb nOf
3 3u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb setN 18446744073709551615u
4 4u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb nOf
5 5u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb setN 18446744073709551616u
6 6u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb setN 115792089237316195423570985008687907853269984665640564039457584007913129639935u
7 7u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb nOf
